__label__books word power made easy about the author about the author norman lewis was born on december 30 1912 in new york and died on september 8 2006 he was an author and grammarian and his flair for english language encouraged him to start writing books he was orphaned at the age of 5 and was raised by his sister lewis wrote monthly columns for a magazine called your life in the 1940's he was always fascinated with the english language and he shared his love for the language through his books
